    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Escape to Tide Out 30A, a luxury 4-bedroom coastal retreat in Inlet Beach that comfortably sleeps 10. Perfect for families, this pet-friendly home offers easy beach access, a community pool, 6 complimentary adult bikes and 2 complementary 20in kids bikes (ages 5-9), and a full beach setup including paddleboards and a CoolCabana. Enjoy a seamless, high-end vacation experience just moments from Rosemary Beach.<br><br>Tide Out 30A is a beautifully designed 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home that sleeps up to 10 guests, blending coastal chic style with modern comfort. Blackout shades in every bedroom and a Dohm sound machine ensure a restful night's sleep.<br><br>Main Level:<br>•\tBright, open-concept living and dining area with plush seating and a 65” smart TV.<br>•\tFully stocked kitchen with both Keurig and drip coffee makers.<br>•\tPrivate first-floor guest suite with a king bed and an adjacent full bathroom.<br><br>Second Level:<br>•\tSpacious loft with a sofa, dedicated workspace, and smart TV.<br>•\tPrimary suite featuring a king bed and an ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower.<br>•\tOne bedroom with a queen bed.<br>•\tOne bedroom with a twin-over-queen bunk bed.<br>•\tA shared full bathroom for the two guest bedrooms.<br>•\tA queen sleeper sofa in the loft provides additional sleeping space.<br><br>Thoughtful Amenities for Your Stay:<br>•\tFor the Family: Pack ’n Play with linens, high chair, sound machine, bathroom stools, kid-friendly dinnerware, board games, and puzzles.<br>•\tFor the Beach & Lake: 2 Isle stand-up paddleboards, a premium CoolCabana, beach wagon, chairs, towels, coolers, beach toys, and life jackets.<br>•\tFor 30a travel: 6 complimentary adult bikes and 2 complementary 20in kids bikes (ages 5-9)<br>•\tFor Your Comfort: Fast Wi-Fi, smart TVs with Hulu access, a screened porch, a second-floor washer/dryer, and an outdoor shower for rinsing off.<br><br>Good to Know<br>•\tFamily friendly<br>• Pet-friendly (dogs only; $250 non-refundable pet fee)<br>• Free parking for 2-3 vehicles (dependent on size)<br>•\tNo parties or events. Guests under 25 must be accompanied by an adult 25 years or older.<br>•\t$500 refundable security deposit hold + signed rental agreement required.<br>•\tRing doorbell camera at the front entry records 24/7 the porch/driveway for security.<br>•\tTampering with or intentionally disabling the security cameras, system, or the Wi-Fi router or modem is strictly prohibited. <br>•\tEarly check-in/late checkout may be available for $50–$100 (over 4 hours requires booking an extra night).<br>•\tAbsolutely no smoking.",
